---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Return Policy" description="Return and Refund Policy for alif. ladies tailor & Boutique.">
  <div class="container section" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 20px;">
    <h1 style="text-transform: uppercase; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: var(--font-heading);">Return &amp; Refund Policy</h1>
    
    <div style="line-height: 1.8; color: #444; font-size: 0.95rem;">
      <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #000; font-family: var(--font-heading);">1. Custom Stitching</h3>
      <p>Due to the personalized nature of bespoke tailoring, <strong>we do not offer returns or cash refunds</strong> on stitched garments once the fabric has been cut and tailored.</p>
      <p>However, we offer <strong>free alterations within 7 days</strong> if the finished garment has a genuine fitting issue.</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #000; font-family: var(--font-heading);">2. Ready-made Products &amp; Laces</h3>
      <p>For boutique products (like Laces, Latkans, or Fabrics):</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Products once cut per customer meter measurements are non-returnable.</li>
        <li>Uncut accessories with physical defects are eligible for replacement within 24 hours of delivery.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #000; font-family: var(--font-heading);">3. Defective Items</h3>
      <p>If you receive a damaged product or wrong design, please contact us on WhatsApp (+91 72504 70009) within 24 hours with photos. We will arrange a replacement or repair immediately.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
